@{
    ViewBag.Title = "Introduction";
}
<div class="col-sm-12">
    <p>
        This site introduces about front-end controls commonly used in many websites of our system.
        For each control, it lists out some frequent use cases which the control or component can be applied to.
        In the turn of each use case, it also suggests the most suitable library and how to use that library to overcome the problem.
        The purpose of this is to ensure all users will explore the same user experiences throughout our system.
    </p>
    <p>
        Moreover, the site defines some rules for HTML, CSS/LESS and JavaScript that all front-end developers must follow when taking care of their tasks.
        It aims at improving collaboration, code quality, and enabling supporting infrastructure.
    </p>
</div>